    {"op": "label", "name": "Scene1-1-11", "line": 4, "indent": 0},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 19, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛她们在地下四处走动时，<br>\n来到了一个令人在意的地方。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 21, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "3_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Duration": 1.2000000476837158, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "Transparent", "SubId": "Overlay"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 23, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "1.8"}},
    {"op": "PlayBgm", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"BgmPath": "Bgm_22_1", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 1, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "过道深处整齐排列着几扇厚实的门，<br>\n上面还挂着比囚犯的房间更严实的挂锁。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 31, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这里是什么地方呢？<br>\n虽然应该进不去里面……", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 33, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "门上面有个小窗，我们看一下里面吧。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 35, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 37, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛战战兢兢地从小窗<br>\n看向了室内。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.2"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 48, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "21_1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [-5.0, 0.0], "Zoom": 0.5, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 50, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.2"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 52, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哇！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCamera", "line": 54, "indent": 0, "params": {"Offset": [0.0, 0.0], "Zoom": 0.0, "Duration": 0.0, "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Scale": {"expression": "{g_backgroundDefaultScale}"}, "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "3_1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——看到室内充满邪气的物品，<br>\n艾玛瞬时脸色煞白，往后退了几步，然后跌坐在地上。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你没事吧，艾玛。<br>\n究竟有什么这么可怕的——", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 65, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "雪莉紧接着往里面探望，<br>\n神色也变得有些凝重。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 69, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这些是……确实……蛮吓人的哦。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry003"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 75, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 78, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（虽然看不太清楚，那些应该是拷问工具。<br>\n　如果反抗的话，就会被严刑拷打吗……？）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 80, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "这里应该是典狱长说的惩罚室了。<br>\n说是，违反规定的囚犯会被关进里面。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 82, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——就在这时。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 84, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 88, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "呜……该死的，开什么玩笑……", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 92, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "放我出去！！呜啊啊啊啊！！", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 94, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛她们听见，在几间惩罚室的某处，<br>\n传来了亚里沙困兽般的呻吟声。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 98, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 99, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 101, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 103, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "果然亚里沙是被关进了惩罚室里。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 105, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "找一下她在哪里吧！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema005"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 107, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 109, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "艾玛和雪莉轮番<br>\n往小窗里望去。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 115, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "不久后，她们找到了亚里沙。<br>\n她被囚禁在其中一间里面。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 117, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 119, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙！", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema006"]}},
    {"op": "HidePrinter", "line": 125, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "SpawnExtended", "line": 126, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "MaskingRectangle", "Params": ["40", "200", "true", "0.3", "#000000"], "ScenePosition": [20.0, 50.0], "Rotation": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 127, "indent": 0, "params": {"Rotation": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "Scale": [1.7999999523162842], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [-20.0, 36.0], "AppearanceAndTransition": "21_1", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 128, "indent": 0, "params": {"Rotation": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "Scale": [1.7999999523162842], "Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [20.0, 32.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off", "SubId": "Front"}},
    {"op": "ChangeActorMaskability", "line": 129, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground-Front", "Alisa-Front"], "Enable": 1}},
    {"op": "AnimateActorExtended", "line": 130, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground-Front"], "Loop": 0, "ScenePositionY": "40", "EasingTypeName": "EaseOutQuad", "Duration": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "AnimateActorExtended", "line": 131, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["Alisa-Front"], "Loop": 0, "ScenePositionY": "35", "EasingTypeName": "EaseOutQuad", "Duration": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "Wait", "line": 132, "indent": 0, "params": {"WaitMode": "0.4"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 134, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊……？你们谁啊……", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 136, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙被绑在了十字架上，<br>\n看起来消耗了不少心神和体力。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 138, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "此情此景实在令人心痛，艾玛感觉有些窒息。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative011"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 140, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 142, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你没事吧？<br>\n你遭了很过分的刑罚吗？", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 144, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙用尖锐的眼神<br>\n狠狠盯着她们两个。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative012"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 146, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "跟你们没关系吧……", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 148, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……啊，不过我要给你们一个忠告。<br>\n之前我往远离宅邸的方向逃跑，<br>\n看到那边有一大堆怪物猫头鹰在监视。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 150, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "它们一发现我，<br>\n马上就有看守赶过来了。越狱太难了。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 152, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "有一道很高的围墙，我想把它烧掉，<br>\n但也做不到。有股神奇力量把我的火焰消除掉了……<br>\n到底是怎样，该死。", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 154, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "（欸，要把围墙烧掉……？也太过于激进了……）", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema007"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 156, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 158, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "唔……我们是以囚犯身份被关押在这里的，<br>\n这座监狱肯定不会轻易让我们逃跑。<br>\n越狱难是理所当然的。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 160, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啧……你是过来取笑我的对吧！<br>\n滚一边去！滚蛋！！", "AuthorId": "Alisa", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Alisa008"]}},
    {"op": "HidePrinter", "line": 162, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "AnimateActorExtended", "line": 163, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground-Front", "Alisa-Front"], "Loop": 0}},
    {"op": "WaitForNextFrame", "line": 164, "indent": 0, "params": {}},
    {"op": "AnimateActorExtended", "line": 165, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground-Front"], "Loop": 0, "ScenePositionY": "44", "EasingTypeName": "EaseOutQuad", "Duration": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "AnimateActorExtended", "line": 166, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["Alisa-Front"], "Loop": 0, "ScenePositionY": "48", "EasingTypeName": "EaseOutQuad", "Duration": "0.5"}},
    {"op": "HideActors", "line": 167, "indent": 0, "params": {"ActorIds": ["MainBackground-Front", "Alisa-Front"], "Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "DestroySpawnedExtended", "line": 168, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "MaskingRectangle", "SubId": "Front", "LogWarning": 1}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 170, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "亚里沙开始激动地喊叫，<br>\n艾玛和雪莉只好离开了现场。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Narrative013"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 176, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Pensive1"}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 177, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 179, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "看来她蛮精神的耶。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 181, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "根据规定，她明天就会被放出来了。<br>\n总之，知道她没事就是好事。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry009"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 183, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯，说得对……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema008"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 185, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 187, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "连脚镣都戴上了，好可怜……", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry010"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 189, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗯？记得亚里沙她<br>\n好像一开始就已经戴着脚镣了。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 191, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [80.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Sherry.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 193, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "哎呀，是这样吗！<br>\n那她一下子就进入高难模式了呢。<br>\n她应该是被当成需要重点留意的对象了吧。", "AuthorId": "Sherry", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Sherry011"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 195, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可能是吧……", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0101Adv15_Ema010"]}},
    {"op": "Gosub", "line": 202, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv"}},
    {"op": "GotoModified", "line": 204, "indent": 0, "params": {"Path": "Act01_Chapter01/Act01_Chapter01_Adv11", "SoftReset": 1}}
  ],
  "translations": {
  "0101Adv15_Narrative001": "艾玛她们在地下四处走动时，<br>\n来到了一个令人在意的地方。",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative002": "过道深处整齐排列着几扇厚实的门，<br>\n上面还挂着比囚犯的房间更严实的挂锁。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry001": "这里是什么地方呢？<br>\n虽然应该进不去里面……",
  "0101Adv15_Ema001": "门上面有个小窗，我们看一下里面吧。",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative003": "艾玛战战兢兢地从小窗<br>\n看向了室内。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema002": "哇！",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative004": "——看到室内充满邪气的物品，<br>\n艾玛瞬时脸色煞白，往后退了几步，然后跌坐在地上。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry002": "你没事吧，艾玛。<br>\n究竟有什么这么可怕的——",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative005": "雪莉紧接着往里面探望，<br>\n神色也变得有些凝重。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry003": "这些是……确实……蛮吓人的哦。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema003": "（虽然看不太清楚，那些应该是拷问工具。<br>\n　如果反抗的话，就会被严刑拷打吗……？）",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry004": "这里应该是典狱长说的惩罚室了。<br>\n说是，违反规定的囚犯会被关进里面。",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative006": "——就在这时。",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa001": "呜……该死的，开什么玩笑……",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa002": "放我出去！！呜啊啊啊啊！！",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative007": "艾玛她们听见，在几间惩罚室的某处，<br>\n传来了亚里沙困兽般的呻吟声。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema004": "！",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry005": "果然亚里沙是被关进了惩罚室里。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema005": "找一下她在哪里吧！",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative008": "艾玛和雪莉轮番<br>\n往小窗里望去。",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative009": "不久后，她们找到了亚里沙。<br>\n她被囚禁在其中一间里面。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema006": "亚里沙！",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa003": "啊……？你们谁啊……",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative010": "亚里沙被绑在了十字架上，<br>\n看起来消耗了不少心神和体力。",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative011": "此情此景实在令人心痛，艾玛感觉有些窒息。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry006": "你没事吧？<br>\n你遭了很过分的刑罚吗？",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative012": "亚里沙用尖锐的眼神<br>\n狠狠盯着她们两个。",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa004": "跟你们没关系吧……",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa005": "……啊，不过我要给你们一个忠告。<br>\n之前我往远离宅邸的方向逃跑，<br>\n看到那边有一大堆怪物猫头鹰在监视。",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa006": "它们一发现我，<br>\n马上就有看守赶过来了。越狱太难了。",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa007": "有一道很高的围墙，我想把它烧掉，<br>\n但也做不到。有股神奇力量把我的火焰消除掉了……<br>\n到底是怎样，该死。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema007": "（欸，要把围墙烧掉……？也太过于激进了……）",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry007": "唔……我们是以囚犯身份被关押在这里的，<br>\n这座监狱肯定不会轻易让我们逃跑。<br>\n越狱难是理所当然的。",
  "0101Adv15_Alisa008": "啧……你是过来取笑我的对吧！<br>\n滚一边去！滚蛋！！",
  "0101Adv15_Narrative013": "亚里沙开始激动地喊叫，<br>\n艾玛和雪莉只好离开了现场。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry008": "看来她蛮精神的耶。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry009": "根据规定，她明天就会被放出来了。<br>\n总之，知道她没事就是好事。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema008": "嗯，说得对……",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry010": "连脚镣都戴上了，好可怜……",
  "0101Adv15_Ema009": "嗯？记得亚里沙她<br>\n好像一开始就已经戴着脚镣了。",
  "0101Adv15_Sherry011": "哎呀，是这样吗！<br>\n那她一下子就进入高难模式了呢。<br>\n她应该是被当成需要重点留意的对象了吧。",
  "0101Adv15_Ema010": "可能是吧……"
}
}
